    new "Ansiosa para recuperar suas roupas, Sarah se vestiu rapidamente."

    old "Atilla walked back onto the training ground, still fully naked. Unlike humans, the orc seemed to experience no shame from his nudity."
    new "Atilla voltou para o campo de treinamento, ainda completamente nu. Diferente dos humanos, o orc parecia não sentir nenhuma vergonha por sua nudez."

    old "He began pointing out weights and instruments."
    new "Ele começou a apontar os pesos e os instrumentos."

    old "One by one he explained to Sarah what to use, how to use it, when to use it."
    new "Um por um, ele explicou a Sarah o que usar, como usar e quando usar."

    old "He explained a strict routine of excercise and diet that she would have to obey to the letter."
    new "Ele explicou uma rotina rigorosa de exercícios e dieta que ela teria que seguir à risca."

    old "After he finished explaining her the routine, he pointed towards his belt and loincloth, still where he had left them."
    new "Depois de terminar de explicar a rotina a ela, ele apontou para o cinto e o pano de cintura, onde ainda os havia deixado."

    old "Fetch that for me."
    new "Traga isso para mim."

    old "Sarah obeyed her new mentor."
    new "Sarah obedeceu ao seu novo mentor."

    old "She picked up the belt and loincloth and tried handing them back to Atilla."
    new "Ela pegou o cinto e o pano de cintura e tentou devolvê-los a Atilla."

    old "He didn't not grab them."
    new "Ele não os pegou."

    old "It's not going to put itself on..."
    new "Não vai se colocar sozinho..."

    old "She grabbed the belt by both ends and tried to loop it around the orc's waist."
    new "Ela agarrou o cinto pelas duas pontas e tentou passá-lo ao redor da cintura do orc."

    old "With his large size, Sarah could barely get her hands around his waists as she tried to fasten the belt back on him."
    new "Com o corpo grande dele, Sarah mal conseguia envolver as mãos ao redor da cintura dele enquanto tentava fechar o cinto novamente."

    old "She pressed her face into his chest. It felt like steel."
    new "Ela pressionou o rosto contra o peito dele. Parecia aço."

    old "Below, pressing against her stomach, she could feel his large member."
    new "Abaixo, pressionando contra o estômago dela, ela podia sentir o grande membro dele."

    old "Finally, she managed to loop the belt and close the buckle, making the orc decent again. As decent as he was ever going to be."
    new "Finalmente, ela conseguiu passar o cinto pelo fecho e fechá-lo, deixando o orc decente novamente — tanto quanto ele jamais seria."

    old "Atilla gave his belt a tug, pleased at her work."
    new "Atilla deu um puxão no cinto dela, satisfeito com o trabalho que ela havia feito."

    old "He turned around and continued his lecture."
    new "Ele se virou e continuou sua lição."

    old "Sarah studiously followed him and absorbed his lessons."
    new "Sarah o seguia com dedicação e absorvia suas lições."
